Qt
--
DWG Checker uses the Qt libraries (the Qt6*.dll files and the plugins folder on
Windows, the Qt frameworks and plugins inside the macOS app), Copyright (C) The
Qt Company Ltd. and other contributors, under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 3 (LGPL-3.0.txt, which adds to GPL-3.0.txt). They are separate
library files, linked dynamically, and can be replaced with other builds of
Qt @Qt6_VERSION@.

Qt's source code: https://download.qt.io/archive/qt/@DWGCHECK_QT_MAJOR_MINOR@/@Qt6_VERSION@/

Qt contains third-party components under their own licenses. Qt lists them,
with their license texts, at https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/licenses-used-in-qt.html


